# MovieVerse – Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env (project root) and fill in your actual values.
# .env is already listed in .gitignore — it will NOT be committed to Git.
#
# ─── TMDB (Movie Database API) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO GET A TMDB API KEY:
#   1. Register at https://www.themoviedb.org/signup
#   2. Go to Settings → API → Request an API key (free for non-commercial use)
#   3. Choose "Developer" and complete the short form
#   4. Copy the API Read Access Token (v4 auth) — it's a long JWT string
#   5. Paste it below (no quotes needed)
#
# SECURITY REMINDER:
#   VITE_ prefixed variables are embedded in the browser bundle at build time.
#   They are NOT secret — anyone who inspects the bundle can read them.
#   Use TMDB's rate-limiting and referrer restrictions for access control.
#   Never commit the actual .env file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_v4_read_access_token_here
VITE_TMDB_BASE_URL=https://api.themoviedb.org/3
VITE_TMDB_IMAGE_BASE=https://image.tmdb.org/t/p
